<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stalexport fell, BIG rose and BPH, Budimex and Elektrim were flat in 1.6-million-zloty Warsaw- bourse continuous trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 3.8 percent in a 27.4-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
